[[Spider Slayer]] is a [[Slayer|Slayer Quest]] that involves killing [[Spider]]s and at the end the [[Tarantula Broodfather]]. A {{SlayerTier|II}} [[Revenant Horror]] must be slain to unlock '''Spider Slayer'''.

